#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:3
#: 4d6beee92574476980b888e7859b55a6
msgid "原子扰动（Atomic Perturb）"
msgstr "Atomic Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:5
#: 730fd2f296b54a5f89cd178fa0c8d149
msgid "**分类：** 扰动"
msgstr "**Category:** Perturbations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:7
#: cbc4d2ff5ef0479aad7727fdcee75684
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:9
#: f9ca70afa02946b8b80cc1a8faeb8b4c
msgid "为每个输入结构生成若干随机位移副本，用于补充平衡位置附近的力和局部曲率信息。它只改变原子笛卡尔坐标，不改变晶胞、周期边界或元素。"
msgstr ""
"Generate several randomly displaced copies of each input structure to add force and "
"local-curvature information around equilibrium positions. Only Cartesian atomic "
"coordinates are changed; the cell, periodic boundaries, and elements remain "
"unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:11
#: bf1d2097ff424c02b6790b089bb4f53d
msgid "随机位移可能缩短原子间距，运行后建议检查最短距离；需要批量把关时，可在后面连接“几何合理性筛选”。"
msgstr ""
"Random displacements can shorten interatomic distances. Check the minimum distance "
"after running, or connect `Geometry Filter` downstream for batch validation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:13
#: bd14cb70e242459fb93f8aa224e18893
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:15
#: 7cee0d5c90914fecbb1ed87c2dcc1d4c
msgid "对原子 $i$，位移从半径为 $d_i$ 的三维球内均匀采样："
msgstr ""
"For atom $i$, the displacement is sampled uniformly from a three-dimensional ball of "
"radius $d_i$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:17
#: e118956562e642e8949c52586bf1c79d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_i=\\rho_i\\hat{\\mathbf u}_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"0\\leq \\rho_i\\leq d_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf r_i'=\\mathbf r_i+\\Delta\\mathbf r_i.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:25
#: 12c0d3cf0c474cf197a492b8c2d23bbd
msgid "因此约束的是位移向量长度 $\\|\\Delta\\mathbf r_i\\|\\leq d_i$，不是 x、y、z 三个分量分别小于 $d_i$。"
msgstr ""
"The constraint therefore applies to the displacement-vector length, "
"$\\|\\Delta\\mathbf r_i\\|\\leq d_i$, rather than requiring each x, y, and z "
"component separately to be smaller than $d_i$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:27
#: 2d4a09934fbd4ef2917e2e649e2a99d5
msgid "未设置逐元素上限时，所有原子使用全局 $d_i=d$。"
msgstr "Without per-element limits, every atom uses the global value $d_i=d$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:28
#: 3783a040cc3740979eb7b645b056e441
msgid "设置逐元素上限后，列出的元素使用自己的 $d_i$，其他元素仍使用全局值。"
msgstr ""
"With per-element limits enabled, listed elements use their own $d_i$ values and all "
"other elements continue to use the global value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:29
#: 30bd3ea7cbf342dab4bd0a1f348eb3cd
msgid "开启“有机分子刚体平移”后，自动识别的有机连通簇共用一个平移向量，分子内部距离不变。若一个分子含多种元素，则采用其中最严格的位移上限。"
msgstr ""
"With `Rigid translation of organic molecules` enabled, each automatically detected "
"organic connected component shares one translation vector, so intramolecular "
"distances remain unchanged. If a molecule contains multiple elements, the strictest "
"displacement limit among them is used."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:30
#: 17248ed52c7d44c49288c7a18b04e356
msgid "扰动后的坐标按原结构 PBC 回到晶胞内；晶胞矩阵和 PBC 标志保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Perturbed coordinates are wrapped into the cell according to the original PBC. The "
"cell matrix and PBC flags remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:32
#: 37bd57679ba240abbb856689d23b7ffc
msgid "两种采样引擎"
msgstr "Two Sampling Engines"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: cf6f2767a7024ffe90a22837596fdf18
msgid "引擎"
msgstr "Engine"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: ff3a11b2304c462081cc0c6d53570ca7
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Use Case"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: e8206bb747c24aeeacdffbe56c4ce5cb
msgid "限制"
msgstr "Limit"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 05fa96699408473d8e5c20afd535b9a8
msgid "Uniform"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 7b9260c782d14d628df254d52c9f77af
msgid "通用默认；任意正输出数"
msgstr "General default; any positive output count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 7590f7b29e0744469dc79b6c35575e47
msgid "伪随机采样"
msgstr "Pseudorandom sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 7351899667da413da681ef7f4c2b19ff
msgid "Sobol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: 808f28061eae4895aed9360f5175e8f3
msgid "少量样本时改善空间覆盖"
msgstr "Improved space coverage for small sample sets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md
#: d99dd6acf3d74a298613c564a52309bc
msgid "最多 7,067 个原子；输出数取 4、8、16…时覆盖性质最好"
msgstr "At most 7,067 atoms; coverage is best with 4, 8, 16, … outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:39
#: b2d6b424a26040c2a46e52c07ded0592
msgid "选择 Sobol 但输出数不是 2 的幂不会改变请求数量，界面只给出提示。"
msgstr ""
"Selecting Sobol with an output count that is not a power of two does not change the "
"requested count; the interface only displays an advisory message."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:41
#: 419845a35eae4367ac00996c2df08522
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:43
#: b3ce9ab5ba9e41bb858e4ae6c463c14e
msgid "为两帧 Si 结构补充近平衡样本"
msgstr "Add Near-Equilibrium Samples for Two Si Frames"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:45
#: bb0d82314e57417680b927cfd35d0979
msgid "导入 2 帧已经弛豫的 Si 结构；"
msgstr "Import two relaxed Si frames;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:46
#: 232e24ca9f4544ca88fab490f1ebb50b
msgid "位移上限设为 `0.10 Å`；"
msgstr "set the displacement limit to `0.10 Å`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:47
#: 11251866e1304a37803112883bc66308
msgid "每个输入生成设为 `20`；"
msgstr "set outputs per input to `20`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:48
#: 9b5273df095942a1b94db22a0213ae6b
msgid "使用 Sobol，并启用固定随机种子。"
msgstr "use Sobol and enable a fixed random seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:50
#: 74f09d2245c148398a39ed602e0c88bc
msgid "最终严格生成 $2\\times20=40$ 帧。抽查每个原子的位移向量长度应不超过 `0.10 Å`，同时检查最短 Si–Si 距离没有进入异常区间。"
msgstr ""
"Exactly $2\\times20=40$ frames are generated. Spot-check that each atomic "
"displacement-vector length is no greater than `0.10 Å`, and verify that the minimum "
"Si–Si distance has not entered an abnormal range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:52
#: c7a18675989549cbb2d89db0e85c4d2a
msgid "含氢体系使用不同上限"
msgstr "Use Different Limits for a Hydrogen-Containing System"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:54
#: c33033951b2a4c9c818157ed4eb78143
msgid ""
"开启“逐元素位移上限”，设置 `H → 0.15 Å`、`O → 0.06 "
"Å`。未列出的元素继续使用全局上限。元素符号不区分输入大小写，但无效符号和重复元素会明确报错，不会静默退回全局值。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `Per-element displacement limits` and set `H → 0.15 Å` and `O → 0.06 Å`. "
"Unlisted elements continue to use the global limit. Element-symbol input is case-"
"insensitive, but invalid symbols and duplicate elements produce explicit errors "
"rather than silently falling back to the global value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:56
#: 3dc8db2ebaf64fed931f6266023c6ef5
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:58
#: d18bd5007b7c43a0a99f257ad0b52f14
msgid "采样引擎（engine_type）"
msgstr "Sampling Engine (engine_type)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:60
#: 2cc02e835dd0408dbb7f2fede49af6b1
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。`0` 为 Sobol，`1` 为 Uniform。Sobol 需要 $3N$ 个维度，因此原子数上限为 7,067。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. `0` selects Sobol and `1` selects Uniform. Sobol requires $3N$ "
"dimensions, which limits the structure to 7,067 atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:62
#: fe8970cebae146cd994b9425b986fde2
msgid "位移上限（max_distance）"
msgstr "Displacement Limit (max_distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:64
#: 1c47b125782a4712939a5e4e4fd88368
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.25`，单位 Å。表示每个原子笛卡尔位移向量的最大长度。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.25`, in Å. This is the maximum Cartesian displacement-vector "
"length for each atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:66
#: 135ba923644448b9a148c16490dcfc0f
msgid ""
"默认值面向需要覆盖较高力非平衡构型的训练集补样。若只补充近平衡构型，通常可改从 `0.05–0.15 Å` 开始。两个相邻原子若相向移动，相对距离最多可能改变约 "
"$2d$，所以较大上限必须配合最短距离和力分布检查。"
msgstr ""
"The default targets training-set augmentation that needs nonequilibrium "
"configurations with relatively high forces. For near-equilibrium sampling only, start"
" around `0.05–0.15 Å`. If two neighboring atoms move toward each other, their "
"separation can change by approximately $2d$, so a large limit must be paired with "
"checks of minimum distances and the force distribution."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:68
#: e1d6d5c7224f4ccbb3b917e1894d1b98
msgid "每个输入生成（max_num）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (max_num)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:70
#: bd124b9086794f49ba67db5d298795c3
msgid "`int`，默认 `50`，范围 `1–10000`。每个输入结构生成的输出数；总输出数为："
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `50`, range `1–10000`. Number of outputs generated from each input "
"structure; the total output count is:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:72
#: ccc38d53754c444282fd03f3d0ea87b4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{input}\\times\\texttt{max\\_num}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:76
#: 18137bb4edff4d9ca839a3c988810db6
msgid "有机分子刚体平移（identify_organic）"
msgstr "Rigid Translation of Organic Molecules (identify_organic)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:78
#: 22ad6913a6214edda99fe1327a9dfff7
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，自动识别的有机连通簇整体平移，内部键长和键角保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, automatically detected organic connected "
"components translate as rigid units, preserving their internal bond lengths and "
"angles."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:80
#: 7ba77e4bb4584ba38f8afd5b388843a6
msgid "使用逐元素上限（use_element_scaling）"
msgstr "Use Per-Element Limits (use_element_scaling)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:82
#: 215c50f19caf4d9489bba5516793aac2
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后显示逐元素位移配置；关闭时所有原子使用全局位移上限。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enabling it displays the per-element displacement "
"configuration. When disabled, all atoms use the global displacement limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:84
#: 8c7c5c951cfc4c87a4da5522405e20a8
msgid "逐元素位移上限（element_scalings）"
msgstr "Per-Element Displacement Limits (element_scalings)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:86
#: b68544e67a054654bf087d03e4697e4b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`dict[str, float] | None`，默认 `None`，单位 Å。例如 `{\"H\": 0.15, \"O\": "
"0.06}`。未列元素使用全局上限；元素符号会规范为标准大小写。无效符号、重复元素、负值或非有限值会停止运行并给出错误。"
msgstr ""
"`dict[str, float] | None`, default `None`, in Å. For example, `{\"H\": 0.15, \"O\": "
"0.06}`. Unlisted elements use the global limit, and symbols are normalized to "
"standard capitalization. Invalid symbols, duplicate elements, negative values, or "
"nonfinite values stop the operation with an error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:88
#: a012c8af81144e839ed806175bfdfafa
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:90
#: 38a2308feda6452ca9c3f4dec5495007
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，相同结构、参数和 seed 得到相同扰动。随机流还会结合结构内容派生，因此数据集重新排序不会改变某一帧自己的结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, the same structure, parameters, and seed "
"produce the same perturbations. The random stream is also derived from the structure "
"content, so reordering the dataset does not change a frame's own results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:92
#: 43b545ff46f446d7af7eb4af5efe4577
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:94
#: e74dbf6557964ab7b3bf48650aa60f57
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Used only when `use_seed=true`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:96
#: b9d6c2a116f44ce79ef0ba9dc8942ed8
msgid "如何判断结果合理"
msgstr "How to Judge Whether the Results Are Reasonable"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:98
#: 1633e95d564f4205bd7d96e05833566b
msgid "输出数量等于“输入帧数 × 每个输入生成数”；"
msgstr "the output count equals input frames × outputs per input;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:99
#: 52410dcbca5f44528b6c258c440c98c6
msgid "每个原子的位移向量不超过对应上限；"
msgstr "each atom's displacement vector remains within its applicable limit;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:100
#: 4b1a9aeb287e435794237c2e1ca5fcc1
msgid "晶胞和 PBC 与输入一致；"
msgstr "the cell and PBC match the input;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:101
#: 461138b3833e4de09f95652a65308bc3
msgid "开启刚体模式后，分子内部距离保持不变；"
msgstr "intramolecular distances remain unchanged when rigid mode is enabled;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:102
#: fa876030319b4f9b868481ca3f2ca288
msgid "最短原子间距没有进入明显非物理区间；"
msgstr "the minimum interatomic distance does not enter an evidently nonphysical range;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:103
#: 28fdac322e404e82a09977850e1dbf68
msgid "重训后应在独立 MD 或受扰动测试集上比较力误差，而不只看混合总 RMSE。"
msgstr ""
"after retraining, compare force errors on an independent MD or perturbed test set "
"rather than looking only at an aggregate mixed RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:105
#: 493510a94c3f4a9d8799f5f4678b99eb
msgid "如果训练集已经包含足量、覆盖目标温区的 MD 轨迹，继续堆叠随机扰动可能只会产生重复样本。"
msgstr ""
"If the training set already contains sufficient MD trajectories covering the target "
"temperature range, adding more random perturbations may produce only redundant "
"samples."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:107
#: c34c679510e44344a852af5d1524811c
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:109
#: 33f1ed4c5ad14d3799c0d4f7dd9b73f2
msgid "**为什么扰动后出现异常短距离？** 本卡只限制每个原子的位移，不做原子对碰撞检测。降低位移上限，或在后面连接“几何合理性筛选”。"
msgstr ""
"**Why do abnormally short distances appear after perturbation?** This card limits "
"only each atom's displacement; it does not perform pairwise collision detection. "
"Reduce the displacement limit or connect `Geometry Filter` downstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:111
#: 7c2d46bb15aa41fda8125cd878f462a1
msgid "**为什么两个输入得到的总输出数翻倍？** `max_num` 是每个输入结构的输出数，而不是整批数据共享的总预算。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does using two inputs double the total output count?** `max_num` is the output "
"count for each input structure, not a total budget shared by the batch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:113
#: 8fda2b7989cf40af9294bd1738760c1d
msgid "**为什么逐元素设置没有运行？** 无效元素符号和重复元素现在会明确停止运行。修正红色字段提示后再执行。"
msgstr ""
"**Why did the per-element settings not run?** Invalid element symbols and duplicate "
"elements now stop the operation explicitly. Correct the field marked in red before "
"running again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:115
#: 8ea418ab1db44126b6b5f0207ccb3a61
msgid "输出合同"
msgstr "Output Contract"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:117
#: 1d9f52b119f64d86b521d24cdfacabad
msgid "每个输入严格输出 `max_num` 个结构；空输入结构保持原行为，返回一个副本。"
msgstr ""
"Each input produces exactly `max_num` structures. An empty input structure retains "
"the existing behavior and returns one copy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:118
#: e14a6fab7fd8416293db98976c54ffed
msgid "`Config_type` 追加 `Pert(d=<上限>,U)` 或 `Pert(d=<上限>,S)`。"
msgstr "`Pert(d=<limit>,U)` or `Pert(d=<limit>,S)` is appended to `Config_type`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:119
#: 307b62c7d7c140aaaba960da765caeb1
msgid "`atomic_perturb` metadata 保存引擎、全局/逐元素上限、刚体模式、seed、派生 seed 和样本序号。"
msgstr ""
"The `atomic_perturb` metadata stores the engine, global and per-element limits, rigid"
" mode, seed, derived seed, and sample index."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:124
#: fce0b593221d429b80409f1c3f55a7f0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"PerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_distance\": 0.1,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 20,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_element_scaling\": false,\n"
"    \"element_scalings\": {},\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "对原子坐标施加随机位移扰动，补充近平衡势能面的局部位移样本。每个原子的随机位移向量长度不超过 `max_distance`，晶格保持不变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply random displacements to atomic positions "
#~ "to sample the local neighborhood of an "
#~ "equilibrium configuration. The length of each "
#~ "atom's displacement vector is at most "
#~ "`max_distance`; the cell remains unchanged."

#~ msgid "开启 `identify_organic` 后有机分子团簇做刚性整体移动，避免分子内键被拉伸。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "When `identify_organic` is enabled, detected organic"
#~ " molecules move as rigid clusters so their"
#~ " internal bonds are not stretched."

#~ msgid "`max_distance` = `0.15` （单位 Å）"
#~ msgstr "`max_distance` = `0.15` Å"

#~ msgid "`engine_type` = `0` （Sobol，少量样本覆盖更均匀）"
#~ msgstr "`engine_type` = `0` (Sobol, for more even directional coverage with a small sample)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "抽查最短键长：0.15 Å 位移下 Si-Si 键长变化应在 ±0.3 Å"
#~ " 以内（两个相邻原子可能向不同方向偏移）。如果出现 < 1.8 Å 的短键，降低 "
#~ "`max_distance`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect the shortest bond lengths. With 0.15"
#~ " Å per-atom displacements, a Si–Si bond "
#~ "can change by up to about ±0.3 Å "
#~ "when neighboring atoms move in opposite "
#~ "directions. If contacts shorter than 1.8 Å "
#~ "appear, reduce `max_distance`."

#~ msgid "如果改善不够，增大 `max_num` 到 100、也增大 `max_distance` 到 0.25 Å"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the improvement is insufficient, try "
#~ "increasing `max_num` to 100 and `max_distance` "
#~ "to 0.25 Å."

#~ msgid "如果体系含多种元素且质量差异大（如含 H + 重元素），考虑开启 `use_element_scaling` 给轻元素更大位移"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For a multielement system with a large "
#~ "mass contrast, such as H plus heavy "
#~ "atoms, consider `use_element_scaling` so light "
#~ "elements can receive larger displacements."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "注意这不是应变百分比，也不是 Cartesian 分量分别的上限——就是一个原子最多被挪多远。室温下原子振动幅度约 "
#~ "0.05~0.1 Å，设 0.15~0.3 Å 通常够用。体系含 H 等轻元素时，H "
#~ "振幅天然更大，建议同时开启 `use_element_scaling`。设到 0.3~0.5 Å "
#~ "以上时，跑完务必抽查最近邻键长——这个量级已经可能拉断键了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This is neither a strain percentage nor "
#~ "a separate bound on each Cartesian component;"
#~ " it is the maximum distance an atom "
#~ "may move. Room-temperature vibrational amplitudes"
#~ " are often around 0.05–0.1 Å, so 0.15–0.3"
#~ " Å is usually sufficient. For light "
#~ "elements such as H, enable `use_element_scaling`."
#~ " At 0.3–0.5 Å or above, always inspect "
#~ "nearest-neighbor distances because bonds may "
#~ "be severely distorted or broken."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后不同元素可以用不同的位移幅度，覆盖全局的 `max_distance`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `false`. Enables element-specific"
#~ " displacement limits that override the global "
#~ "`max_distance`."

#~ msgid "多元素体系（比如含 H + 重元素）建议开。H 在室温下的振动幅度远大于重元素，用同一个 `max_distance` 会导致要么 H 位移太小、要么重元素位移太大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable this for systems with strongly "
#~ "different atomic masses, such as H plus "
#~ "heavy elements. A single `max_distance` may "
#~ "otherwise under-sample H or over-displace "
#~ "the heavy atoms."

#~ msgid "`dict[str, float] | None`，默认 None。元素 → 最大位移的映射。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`dict[str, float] | None`, default: `None`. "
#~ "Mapping from element symbols to maximum "
#~ "displacements."

#~ msgid "格式如 `{\"H\": 0.5, \"O\": 0.15, \"Si\": 0.1}`。只对列出的元素生效，没列出的元素仍然用上面的 `max_distance`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For example, `{\"H\": 0.5, \"O\": 0.15, "
#~ "\"Si\": 0.1}`. Listed elements use their "
#~ "mapped limits; all others continue to use "
#~ "the global `max_distance`."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`use_element_scaling` 必须为 true。"
#~ msgstr "Used only when `use_element_scaling` is `true`."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。两个不同的 seed 会产生两组不同的位移分布。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `0`. Random seed, used only"
#~ " when `use_seed` is enabled. Different seeds "
#~ "produce different displacement sets."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**扰动后出现异常短键（< 1.0 Å）。** 两个相邻原子随机位移方向恰好相反，距离骤减。降低 "
#~ "`max_distance` 或增大 `max_num` 后通过 `FPS Filter` "
#~ "筛掉短键结构。这是随机扰动的固有局限——它不做碰撞检测。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Perturbation creates an abnormally short contact"
#~ " below 1.0 Å.** Two neighboring atoms "
#~ "happened to move toward each other. Reduce "
#~ "`max_distance`, or generate a larger pool and"
#~ " remove invalid structures before representative "
#~ "selection. This card does not perform "
#~ "collision detection, so geometry validation remains"
#~ " necessary."

#~ msgid "**分子晶体中分子碎掉了。** `identify_organic` 没开。开启后整个分子团簇做刚性平移，分子内键长完全保留。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Molecules in a molecular crystal are "
#~ "distorted or broken.** Enable `identify_organic` so"
#~ " each molecular cluster is translated rigidly "
#~ "and its internal bond lengths are preserved."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**扰动后力 MAE 没改善。** 可能 `max_distance` "
#~ "太小，位移落在模型已经学好的线性区内。增大到 0.3~0.5 Å "
#~ "试试。也可能体系本身的势能面非谐性很强，随机扰动方向不一定是最需要的——此时用 `Vib Mode Perturb` "
#~ "替代，沿真实振动模方向做位移。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Force MAE does not improve after adding "
#~ "perturbed data.** `max_distance` may be too "
#~ "small, leaving samples inside an already "
#~ "learned linear region; test 0.3–0.5 Å while"
#~ " validating geometry. If the potential-energy "
#~ "surface is strongly anharmonic, arbitrary directions"
#~ " may be inefficient. Use `Vib Mode Perturb`"
#~ " to displace along physically meaningful "
#~ "vibrational modes instead."

#~ msgid "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现；几何不同的输入帧使用不同但稳定的派生随机流。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce"
#~ " the same input; geometrically different frames"
#~ " use distinct but stable derived random "
#~ "streams."

#~ msgid "对原子坐标施加随机位移扰动，补充近平衡势能面的局部位移样本。每个原子的随机位移向量长度不超过 `最大距离`（`max_distance`），晶格保持不变。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

