#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 50 个结构，每个原子的坐标在原始位置附近随机偏移 0~0.15 Å"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** 50 structures in which every atom"
#~ " is displaced by 0–0.15 Å from its "
#~ "original position."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后用一段 MD 轨迹做推理，力的 MAE 应该显著下降，接近静力学测试集水平"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After DFT labeling and retraining, evaluate a"
#~ " held-out MD trajectory. Its force MAE "
#~ "should decrease substantially toward the static-"
#~ "test error."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "抽查最短键长：0.15 Å 位移下 Si-Si 键长变化应在 ±0.3 Å"
