#~ "same input, parameters, and seed reproduce "
#~ "exactly the same perturbations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对比实验或者需要复现时打开，纯探索阶段可以关着。seed "
#~ "会与单帧结构内容共同派生，因此几何不同的帧不会机械复用同一组位移；重新排列数据集不会改变某一帧自己的结果。完全相同的重复帧仍会得到相同扰动，若希望把重复帧扩成不同样本，应先去重或分批使用不同"
#~ " seed。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable it for controlled comparisons or "
#~ "reproducibility; leave it off for unconstrained "
#~ "exploration. The seed is combined with each"
#~ " structure's content, so geometrically different "
#~ "frames do not reuse the same displacements,"
#~ " and reordering the dataset does not change"
#~ " a frame's result. Exactly duplicated frames "
#~ "still receive identical perturbations; deduplicate "
#~ "them or process batches with different seeds"
#~ " when distinct augmentation is wanted."

